# tests/

Integration tests for the udex-server datastore implementations. Tests are organized by datastore type and use rstest with tokio-shared-rt to ensure reliable test isolation and state management across async test suites.

## Files

- `postgres_integration_tests.rs` -- PostgreSQL datastore integration tests covering index creation, context operations, and entry read/write workflows
